\f0\fs22 The pre-inauguration party had been underway for some hours before the Holy Momma and the Holy Aunts arrived. Kathy carried Sarah\'92s favourite office chair\'97the one she\'92d adjusted all the heights, tilts, lumber supports and angles over several months until the feeling of her internal organs being squashed to pancake batter by the little lodger inside her had been dialled down to barely sufferable. Kathy wheeled the chair through the crowd in the main barroom where two picnic chairs flanked the Holy Thrones of partly melted bobbleheads, gilt trimmings oceanic velvet and no padding to speak of. They had been trucked back from The Domain on Monday. Kathy kicked over the Throne of the Holy Momma, hoiked the office chair onto the dais and set it in the  throne\'92s place, while Hayley moved the picnic chair on the Great Teacher\'92s side over to where she and Kathy cold sit together during the ceremony.\
Sarah sat immediately and sighed in the pleasure of taking her weight off her feet. Hayley stood by Sarah and cased the room while Kathy went to the bar to fetch a glass of water for Sarah, and stiff bourbons for Hayley and herself.\
Walter, the ex-mayor of the now defunct 
\fs20 GET BENT
\fs22  movement, emerged  from the milling of guests, and sat in the Great Teacher\'92s throne . He was wearing a shirt with a collar, and was clutching a rolled-up festival poster in his fist; he had been holding it the same way for forty minutes. Sarah placed a hand on his, even though the kid showed no signs he was shaken by the deaths of so many Elvi. The poster in Walter\'92s hand had been signed personally by the original High Elvis; Walter was holding it as kind of totem of life and death, and Sarah simply missed the signs.\
Hayley waved away  the bourbon with a kind of on-duty officiousness. Kathy shrugged, sat down and drank both in single gulps.\
\'93I\'92ll get drunk just kissing you,\'94 Hayley said.\
Kathy giggled. \'93It\'92s good to know I have that affect on you.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

