\f0\i0 The people who\'92d expect nothing from him the most would be the Elvines he\'92d slept with followed by his entourage of Elvisettes (only the Great Teacher was allowed to bring Elvisettes). \
But the fawning Elvisettes and the grieving Elvines\'97most had been present at 
\fs20 GET BENT until the end\'97did not mix well. 
